<title>MALAYSIA: Bridgecon, CMS shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Bridgecon, CMS shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Bridgecon Bhd and Cahaya Mata Sarawak Bhd (CMS) were suspended on Tuesday at the companies' request pending announcements, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official said.</p>
<p>Shares of Bridgecon, a civil engineering and construction company, closed at 19.00 ringgit on Monday, and CMS, a cement manufacturer, at 17.80 ringgit.</p>
<p>Offficials at both companies could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
